essage": "503 Service Unavailable: rollback", "attempts": 4, "runtime_actions": ["backoff_retry", "backoff_retry", "backoff_retry", "backoff_retry"], "failure_class": "semantic", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 29215, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01EiMgmn6DyFx8VMv71yGQwL", "kind": "unavailable", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 32452, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_019hdUoiTmnkWMEecxeQZXuX", "tool": "deploy", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 37452, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019hdUoiTmnkWMEecxeQZXuX", "tool": "deploy", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 37452, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019hdUoiTmnkWMEecxeQZXuX", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 42818, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0183yUhW3W8pzEcnPcxusg86", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 43118, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0183yUhW3W8pzEcnPcxusg86", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 43118, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0183yUhW3W8pzEcnPcxusg86", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 43118, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01YMvhYo3HcBAu7T95gycMWy", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 deploy (error rate 0.18, unhealthy in us-east, us-west, eu-west). Deployment history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production. The rollback endpoint was persistently unavailable (503 after multiple retries), so v2.3.0 was re-deployed via the deploy tool, which rolled it out to all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). v2.3.1 remains the suspected cause and should not be re-deployed until investigated. Rollback-tool unavailability should also be looked into.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 43718, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YMvhYo3HcBAu7T95gycMWy", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 43718, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YMvhYo3HcBAu7T95gycMWy", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 48887, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Summary:\n\n**Diagnosis**\n- checkout-api was on v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production (v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and unhealthy, so it was excluded).\n\n**Rollback**\n- The `rollback` tool was persistently unavailable (503 after four retries, nothing executed).\n- Since v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production (so no change-manager approval was needed), I re-deployed it via the `deploy` tool, which rolled it out to all three production regions.\n- Verified afterward: checkout-api is now on v2.3.0 everywhere, **healthy**, error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for checkout-api; on-call has been paged. The summary describes the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback to v2.3.0 and how it was performed, and flags two follow-ups: investigate v2.3.1 before any re-deploy, and look into the rollback endpoint's unavailability.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and release history for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015st2hxvpxGg3ns9g2P1phb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01EWoWaTJwRTwHQwZf8iHaA7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01EiMgmn6DyFx8VMv71yGQwL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_019hdUoiTmnkWMEecxeQZXuX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "deploy", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "v2.3.0 is now rolled out in all three regions. Let me verify health and open the incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0183yUhW3W8pzEcnPcxusg86", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01YMvhYo3HcBAu7T95gycMWy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 deploy (error rate 0.18, unhealthy in us-east, us-west, eu-west). Deployment history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production. The rollback endpoint was persistently unavailable (503 after multiple retries), so v2.3.0 was re-deployed via the deploy tool, which rolled it out to all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). v2.3.1 remains the suspected cause and should not be re-deployed until investigated. Rollback-tool unavailability should also be looked into.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Done. Summary:\n\n**Diagnosis**\n- checkout-api was on v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production (v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and unhealthy, so it was excluded).\n\n**Rollback**\n- The `rollback` tool was persistently unavailable (503 after four retries, nothing executed).\n- Since v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production (so no change-manager approval was needed), I re-deployed it via the `deploy` tool, which rolled it out to all three production regions.\n- Verified afterward: checkout-api is now on v2.3.0 everywhere, **healthy**, error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for checkout-api; on-call has been paged. The summary describes the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback to v2.3.0 and how it was performed, and flags two follow-ups: investigate v2.3.1 before any re-deploy, and look into the rollback endpoint's unavailability.", "type": "text"}]}]}